Package: rsageCompare
Title: Group Comparison Module for R Sage
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R Sage contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@rsage.dev")
Description: Compares groups and conditions: independent, paired and
    one-sample t tests with Welch's correction and rank-based
    alternatives, one- and two-way analysis of variance with Welch's
    test, Kruskal-Wallis and post hoc comparisons (Tukey, Games-Howell,
    Dunn), and contingency tables with chi-squared and Fisher's exact
    tests. Each analysis reports effect sizes with confidence intervals
    and checks its assumptions, pointing to the alternative when one
    does not hold.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: rsage (>= 0.1.0), ggplot2, effectsize, stats, utils
Suggests: car, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
